# The note Sol touches or pierces a remote control (a LangGraph sub-part); the side changes the sequence.
# Source: chat 2 T35 (owner) and T35.3 (the fixed default table, D80); bindings and search (T12).
LANGUAGE RSOS 0.2
WORLD ai_room
PROFILE owner
HOST team KIND agent CHANNELS haptic, visual STATES eagle
OBJECT sol KIND note DOMAIN music
PROPERTY sol.frequency = 392
COLOUR sol red STATE drive
OBJECT remote KIND agent_family DOMAIN ai REPRESENTS langgraph.router
USE HOST team
TOUCH sol ON remote AT top
PIERCE sol THROUGH remote FROM top DEPTH 3 AS remote_sol
PIERCE sol THROUGH remote FROM left DEPTH 3 AS remote_sol_left
SEARCH contact.bottom OVER lateral, local_contact, multi_layer METRIC task_success
PIERCE sol THROUGH remote FROM bottom DEPTH 2 AS remote_sol_bottom
USE PROFILE owner
MEANING contact.top = local_contact SCOPE state IN eagle
USE STATE eagle
TOUCH sol ON remote AT top
